# Pip — TokenPet character, style B (pixel mochi with a sprout).
# Hand-placed pixels. Licensed separately from the app code: see assets/LICENSE.md.
# Format: "palette" lines map one char to an sRGB hex; "." is transparent.
# Each "frame <state> <n>" block is followed by exactly <height> rows of <width> chars.
